#: ../../source/wireguard/index.rst:2
msgid "WireGuard Management (`wireguard`)"
msgstr "WireGuard 管理 (`wireguard`)"

#: ../../source/wireguard/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"The ``wireguard`` utility is a powerful command-line tool for deploying "
"and managing WireGuard servers and clients using Docker and Docker "
"Compose. It simplifies the entire process, from generating configurations"
" to controlling the services."
msgstr "``wireguard`` 工具是一个功能强大的命令行工具，用于通过 Docker 和 Docker Compose 部署和管理 WireGuard 服务器与客户端。它简化了从生成配置到控制服务的整个过程。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/index.rst:6
msgid ""
"This tool is designed to be self-contained within the "
"``clash_tools/wireguard`` directory."
msgstr "该工具被设计为在 ``clash_tools/wireguard`` 目录内自包含。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/index.rst:9
msgid "Core Features"
msgstr "核心特性"

#: ../../source/wireguard/index.rst:11
msgid ""
"**Automated Configuration**: Generates all necessary WireGuard and Docker"
" Compose configuration files from simple Python settings."
msgstr "**自动化配置**：根据简单的 Python 设置文件，生成所有必需的 WireGuard 和 Docker Compose 配置文件。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/index.rst:12
msgid ""
"**Service Management**: Easily start, stop, and manage server and client "
"services with ``up`` and ``down`` commands."
msgstr "**服务管理**：通过 ``up`` 和 ``down`` 命令轻松启动、停止和管理服务器及客户端服务。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/index.rst:13
msgid ""
"**Key Generation**: Includes a helper command to generate WireGuard key "
"pairs."
msgstr "**密钥生成**：包含一个辅助命令来生成 WireGuard 密钥对。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/index.rst:14
msgid ""
"**Easy Editing**: Open configuration files directly in your default "
"editor."
msgstr "**轻松编辑**：直接在您的默认编辑器中打开配置文件。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/index.rst:17
msgid "Workflow"
msgstr "工作流"

#: ../../source/wireguard/index.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Generate Keys**: Use ``wireguard genkey`` to create private/public key "
"pairs for the server and each client."
msgstr "**生成密钥**：使用 ``wireguard genkey`` 为服务器和每个客户端创建私钥/公钥对。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/index.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Configure**: Fill in the ``server_settings.py`` and "
"``client_settings.py`` files with the generated keys and your desired "
"network settings."
msgstr "**配置**：在 ``server_settings.py`` 和 ``client_settings.py`` 文件中填入生成的密钥和您期望的网络设置。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/index.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Deploy**: Run ``wireguard server up`` on your server machine and "
"``wireguard client up`` on your client machine."
msgstr "**部署**：在您的服务器上运行 ``wireguard server up``，在客户端机器上运行 ``wireguard client up``。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/index.rst:24
msgid "Documentation Contents"
msgstr "文档内容"

#: ../../source/wireguard/index.rst:33
msgid "Utility Commands"
msgstr "辅助命令"

#: ../../source/wireguard/index.rst:36
msgid "genkey"
msgstr "genkey"

#: ../../source/wireguard/index.rst:38
msgid ""
"Generate a new WireGuard private and public key pair. These keys are "
"essential for configuring both the server and clients."
msgstr "生成一个新的 WireGuard 私钥和公钥对。这些密钥对于配置服务器和客户端至关重要。"

